cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Phantom NLOS: Sub-Direct-Path UWB CIR False-NLOS Simulation Benchmark"
message: "If you reference this archived simulation benchmark, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Imagiyy"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Imagiyy/uwb-cir-false-nlos-simulation"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-27"
abstract: >-
  Completed, simulation-only benchmark evaluating sub-direct-path UWB Channel
  Impulse Response (CIR) multipath pulse injection and false-NLOS anchor
  exclusion robustness across classical rules, gradient-boosted trees, 1D-CNNs,
  and InSight (REMNet, SVM, XGBoost) baselines on Fontaine IIoT19/IIoT20 (DW1000)
  and Santamaria (DW3000) datasets.
keywords:
  - uwb
  - ultra-wideband
  - dw3000
  - dw1000
  - channel-impulse-response
  - nlos-detection
  - physical-layer-security
  - remnet
  - simulation
